<Slide style={{ background: '#F5F1E6', padding: '40px 64px', fontFamily: '宋体' }}>
  <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end', height: 72, position: 'relative', zIndex: 5 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 40, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1F3A34', lineHeight: 1.15 }}>概念卡第五栏</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#6B6B6B' }}>反例怎么补</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 472, marginTop: 20, flexDirection: 'column', position: 'relative', zIndex: 5 }}>
  <Box style={{ height: 472, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 30, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1F3A34' }}>概念卡第五栏：“一个反例”</Text>
    <Box style={{ marginTop: 22, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 27, color: '#1F3A34', lineHeight: 2.1, background: 'rgba(31,58,52,0.06)', padding: 14 }}>不是“我没有例子”，是“这个概念在哪里不成立”。</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 27, color: '#1F3A34', lineHeight: 2.1, background: 'rgba(31,58,52,0.06)', padding: 14, marginTop: 10 }}>反例的价值在边界：说清“哪里不像”，概念才真的归你。</Text>
    </Box>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 26, color: '#B4552D', marginTop: 22 }}>课上补一张：从你本周的卡里挑一张，当堂把第五栏写上。</Text>
  </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 40, marginTop: 12, borderTop: '1px solid rgba(31,58,52,0.2)', flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', paddingTop: 8, position: 'relative', zIndex: 5 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#6B6B6B' }}>《乡土中国》· 第 3 课时</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#B4552D' }}>17/18</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>